{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1036634-solar-demesnes","id":1036634,"title":"Solar Demesnes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-23T08:10:55-08:00","id":1036634,"title":"Solar Demesnes","content":"Can anybody help me with coming up with what a solar demesne might look like? It's a greater demesne, but I don't know how overtly magical the sorts of effects in something like that should be. It's got to be situated somewhere in the West - so on an island, most likely - but other than that , anything goes really.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T08:31:58-08:00","id":1036650,"title":"","content":"Perhaps some manner of volcanic island, where the andisol and sun has given rise to dense clusters of unique yellow flowers that bloom every season. Those who dwell on the slopes of the volcano develop increasingly glassy-looking eyes, black eyes that, in their twilight years, can see dematerialized spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 01-23-2017, 11:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T09:06:13-08:00","id":1036668,"title":"","content":"First off, it will be in a high, sunny place. We don't know how obvious the effects of a demesne's presence are, so I tend to go with &quot;moderately.&quot; For a Solar demesne, the sun rise a little earlier and sets a little later than it does in other places, or things tend toward white and gold colouration. Temperatures warmer than would normally be expected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1184,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","user":"LadyLens","date":". 01-23-2017, 05:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T09:23:28-08:00","id":1036674,"title":"","content":"I'd make it so no matter the weather, the sun is somehow breaking through and visible when within the manse. If it were enclosed, either a class ceiling or an opening in the roof that allows one to follow the path of the sun in the sky.<br /> <br /> I'd allow for lots of water features to reflect the light of the sun as well. Brilliant Sunflowers blooming in all seasons. Naturally reflective surfaces, stone polished like glass. Other stuff light that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T10:37:53-08:00","id":1036703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1036634-solar-demesnes?p=1036674#post1036674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd make it so no matter the weather, the sun is somehow breaking through and visible when within the manse.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's no manse, though - the OP said it was a demesne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T10:47:09-08:00","id":1036707,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1036634-solar-demesnes?p=1036703#post1036703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's no manse, though - the OP said it was a demesne.</div> </div> </div> </div>I misspoke. I'd mean the same thing if I'd said demesne. But a valid clarification. And that would take away the &quot;glass panels&quot; bit I'd suggested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T11:47:14-08:00","id":1036745,"title":"","content":"I had an idea that perhaps anything left in the sun during the day for more than an hour or so develops a slight glow visible in the dark, and feels warm to the touch for several hours afterwards.<br /> <br /> This, of course, means that much of the island glows at night, and can be seen like a lighthouse or a beacon from quite a long way away at sea (with attendant possible plot hooks with wayward ships, investigating Realm patrols and so on).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 01-23-2017, 04:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T13:57:06-08:00","id":1036816,"title":"","content":"Far be it from me to trashpost a meme... But it may even just be a place where when the sun hits the ridge <i>just</i> right, the hills just <i>sing</i>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/76b9-QjzypE/hqdefault.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Edit: A bit more seriously, it might be things like... The sun feels <i>stronger</i> there. Hell, it may even feel physically painful to Abyssals, Infernals, and other Creatures of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T14:34:32-08:00","id":1036845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1036634-solar-demesnes?p=1036745#post1036745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had an idea that perhaps anything left in the sun during the day for more than an hour or so develops a slight glow visible in the dark, and feels warm to the touch for several hours afterwards.<br /> <br /> This, of course, means that much of the island glows at night, and can be seen like a lighthouse or a beacon from quite a long way away at sea (with attendant possible plot hooks with wayward ships, investigating Realm patrols and so on).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Some other associations for Solar demanses include olives, height, open spaces and invincibility. If you want it to be highly visible, you could make it a plateau with with an untended olive orchard on top. Instead of having everything glow, you could have just the olives shed light which serve as beacon. They could also probably be used as an ingredient in age staving cordial or something making them highly sought after.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1g_IC644YJoiVAm6ngqcBmsQtff2YYtd3pDbZpaOxx4o\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Character Creation Tool may be downloaded here.</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool\" target=\"_blank\">The thread talking about the tool can be found here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1136654-exalted-seats-of-power\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted: Seats of Power is a homebrewed manse creation system.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1oaq3wk7lJKZ022SUA4iPfGzMpmBTNXlM\" target=\"_blank\">I have a rewrite of the craft system which can be downloaded here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1070312-i-got-my-book-it-s-super-fancy-and-i-can-t-read-the-cover/page2\" target=\"_blank\">I like the Mesoamerican look</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2346-demac","name":"Demac","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T14:46:46-08:00","id":1036853,"title":"","content":"The demesnes could be on a plateau/mountaintop/volcano, and emanate warmth, boldness and glory. People who live around there perhaps are tall and bronze skinned, and find easy warmth and inspiration. Perhaps dreams often come to those sleeping there about how to seek glory or the direction they should take grasp what they desire in themselves. Perhaps powerful stimulant herbs, like a golden Ginseng can be found there that can make keep one awake as if they had a nights sleep if they brew it, and it can offset fatigue as long as they have it in their system, crashing afterwords, think mystical redbull or something.<br /> <br /> Maybe children conceived on the mountain are normally hale and hearty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T18:18:07-08:00","id":1036959,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Greater Solar Demesne </b></span> <br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Cresting the ridge of what was believed to be a high plateau you come upon a brilliant caldera of shimmering crystals, a solid river of warm gold orichalcum emanating from a dais radiating infinite colors.</i><i> Stepping across the boundary of the crater your mind, body, and soul are uplifted becoming as light and warm as air on the breeze. As the light of uncountable geodes reflect upon your skin the searing power of the sun passes through you, burning away the barriers between your mind and righteous purpose, leaving your soul bare before the unconquered sun. Stepping lightly over crystal and hardened gold you arrive at the dais. Blinded by your passion and desire to become one with the light you follow a naturally carved path deep within the heart of the demesne. The walls lined with the purest gemstones amplifying the light as you walk to your journeys end. Before you a single solid beam of light, impossible to gaze upon, strikes the center of a boiling pool of liquid orichalcum. Within is a single pulsing sphere of materialized light the size of a child's fist</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> This could produce a naturally occurring hearthstone that requires itself be set in orichalcum and enhances any action taken to pursue Defining intimacy for a righteous cause. Or it could do something super cool like enhance sorcery or it could just be a sorcerous competent to a powerful artifact that creates giant doom lasers. Have fun with it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}